      "editor": "Umbraco.RichText",
      "value": {
        "markup": "<p>Cask 2026/001 went into the far corner of warehouse two this morning: a refill American oak hogshead, filled at 63.5% from the middle of the run.</p><p>The spirit is floral to the point of being obvious about it — orchard blossom, a little pear — and the oak will soften that rather than cover it. Ask us again in twelve years.</p>",
        "blocks": null
      }
    },
